  System Reference Document Notice
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  SDR5E's game mechanics and compendium content (spells, species, classes,
  subclasses, feats, magic items, creatures, and rules text under
  packs/*.json) are built on Open Game Content from the System Reference
  Document 5.2.1 ("SRD 5.2.1"), released by Wizards of the Coast, Inc.
  under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  ("CC-BY-4.0").

  Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
  SRD 5.2.1: https://www.dndbeyond.com/srd

  System Reference Document 5.2.1    Copyright 2024, Wizards of the Coast LLC

  This SRD content has been altered from the original: reformatted from
  markdown into JSON compendium entries and adapted to SDR5E's own field
  schema (converted units, restructured stat blocks, added system-specific
  fields). Per CC-BY-4.0 §3(a)(1)(A), no endorsement by Wizards of the Coast
  is implied.

  ── 1. Declared Product Identity ──────────────────────────────────────────
  Not covered by the SRD license — proprietary to SDR5E:
