    • All proper names, lore and setting text not sourced from the SRD
    • All artwork and graphic design
    • The "Resonance" mechanics — narrative and specific implementation
    • The "Grimdark" system setting

  ── 2. SRD-Derived Content ────────────────────────────────────────────────
